sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Patient/Front Desk
    participant Sch as SchedulingService
    participant Q as QueueService
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService

    P->>Sch: Book appointment (patientId, providerId, branchId, slot)
    Sch->>DB: Check schedule/availability
    Sch->>DB: Create Appointment (status SCHEDULED)
    Sch->>Audit: audit appointment.booked
    Sch-->>P: Appointment booked
    Note over P: On arrival
    P->>Q: Check-in / create Visit + QueueEntry
    Q->>DB: Create Visit (status IN_PROGRESS/OPEN as configured)
    Q->>DB: Create QueueEntry (status WAITING) scoped to branch/department
    Q->>Audit: audit visit.checkin / queue.joined
    Q-->>P: Checked in, queue position
    Note over Q: Queue displayed on branch-scoped DisplayDevice
